(search-linear)
*title Linear search target
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=srch-1 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file search.dat time xecfc xecfcdt
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*search 1 vary x-velocity until xecfc=20926646.3255 on segment 1, trajectory 1
  xlo=50 xhi=150 xest=90 dx=10 tol=0.001 xref=100 fref=1000 maxitr=20 print=1 integ=0
*end
